+between ranks, so `split_layer_steps` is not taken, nor the recipe's prompt-feature injection); `prefill_chunk_steps`
+keeps this tree's MTP head rows after the last layer, and MTP streams still draft in the short rounds between slices;
+the recipe's copy drafts and replayed heads are not in this tree. On the attention/expert split's attention node each
+slice is one forward of the AFD wire over the chunk's MoE layers in it (`afd.MODE_SLICE`, wire version 2: the MCDMA
+request header's word 6 carries a slice's layer count); that wire mode is this tree's own design, not part of the
+recipe, and the startup layer timings run as whole prompt-chunk forwards with the expert nodes live.
+`TF_GLM_FILL_BUDGET_MS` is off unless set (0: every prompt chunk one forward, as before).
