+                        head: bool = True):
+    """``prefill_chunk`` as a generator for layer-sliced fills (TF_GLM_FILL_BUDGET_MS, MiaAI-Lab recipe patch 0062):
+    the chunk's forward yields after each layer (``forward.compute_steps``); the taps, the MTP head's rows and the
+    commit run only after the last layer; returns what ``prefill_chunk`` returns. On the AFD attention node the
+    caller sends each slice's header (``multi.MultiDecoder._afd_slice``), not this function."""
